        <choice no="2" is_answer="true">$\frac{E}{R} = \frac{T_{1} T_{2}}{T_{2} - T_{1}} \ln 2$</choice>
        <choice no="3" is_answer="false">$\frac{E}{R} = \frac{( T_{2} - T_{1} ) T_{2}}{T_{1}} \ln 2$</choice>
        <choice no="4" is_answer="false">$\frac{E}{R} = \frac{2 T_{1} T_{2}}{T_{2} - T_{1}}$</choice>
      </choices>
      <answer source="정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)" cross_check="일치">2</answer>
      <explanation_ref file="반응공학_해설.xml" question_no="13">[정답 2번] 긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기) (핵심 개념·이론 이해형) | 핵심어: 에서 빈도인자(frequency factor) | 정답 선지: $\frac{E}{R} = \frac{T_{1} T_{2}}{T_{2} - T_{1}} \ln 2$</explanation_ref>
